#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:19
#: 641ed4420b5d411282b5e4fd0436da04
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:21
#: cc7eb15177c24575971552e0227945c4
msgid ""
"Connect the camera's SHUTTER pin to one of the autopilot's PWM outputs (e.g."
" AUXOUT 5).  Below is the wiring for a ADTi 24sv3 but the port location may "
"be different for each camera type. Please open the `ADTi support site "
"<https://www.adti.camera/support>`__, select your camera type and refer to "
"the \"Camera Engineer Drawings\" to find the SHUTTER pin location for your "
"camera"
msgstr ""
"将相机的 SHUTTER 引脚连接至飞控的某路 PWM 输出（例如 AUXOUT 5）。以下接线适用于 ADTi "
"24sv3，但每种相机类型的接口位置可能不同。请打开 `ADTi 支持网站 "
"<https://www.adti.camera/support>`__，选择您的相机类型，参阅「Camera Engineer Drawings」查找"
" SHUTTER 引脚位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:28
#: 1bec6afc950046f2a40404ffd5a9b6ef
msgid ""
"To control the camera shutter using PWM set the following parameters.  These"
" parameters assume the autopilot's AUXOUT 5 is connected to the camera's "
"shutter trigger"
msgstr "使用 PWM 控制相机快门，请设置以下参数。假设飞控的 AUXOUT 5 连接至相机快门触发器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:30
#: 984d2b33c99f4a93a3e13302bb5a1f48
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE <CAM1_TYPE>` = 1 (Servo)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE <CAM1_TYPE>` = 1（舵机）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:31
#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:39
#: 41c193c4b1c14f2696b9665c3a7113c7 d5b48aa64a0a4936a96aa51edc547bec
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_DURATION <CAM1_DURATION>` = 0.4 seconds"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_DURATION <CAM1_DURATION>` = 0.4 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:32
#: ace2480f669d45a8b8c4204ae184f47c
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_OFF <CAM1_SERVO_OFF>` = 1250"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_OFF <CAM1_SERVO_OFF>` = 1250"

