msgstr ":ref:`SERVO13_FUNCTION <SERVO13_FUNCTION>` = -1（GPIO）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:44
#: 8275d2eee98a4375b5a7249bb1dcd5f1
msgid ""
"Optionally the camera shutter can be triggered from a transmitter auxiliary "
"switch.  The parameter below assumes the pilot wishes to use RC channel 9"
msgstr "也可通过遥控器辅助开关触发相机快门。以下参数假设飞手希望使用 RC 通道 9："

#: ../../source/docs/common-adti-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:46
#: 83079f4e480c4e078ccc8b1697bc5c11
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 9 (\"Camera Trigger\") to take a picture"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 9（「Camera Trigger」）以拍摄照片"

